---
title: James J Nadeau | Contact
description: Send James J Nadeau a message about a project, a question, or work.
---

h1.text-center Contact
.card.card-default.my-3
  .card-body
    p Questions, a project you want help with, or a mistake you found here? Send a note and I'll reply by email.
    // [html-validate-disable attribute-boolean-style: the build serialises required as required=""]
    form(name='contact' method='POST' action='/contact/thanks/' data-netlify='true' netlify-honeypot='bot-field')
      input(type='hidden' name='form-name' value='contact')
      p.d-none
        label
          | Leave this empty:
          input(name='bot-field' type='text' tabindex='-1' autocomplete='off')
      .mb-3
        label.form-label(for='contact-name') Your name
        input#contact-name.form-control(name='name' type='text' autocomplete='name')
      .mb-3
        label.form-label(for='contact-email') Your email
        input#contact-email.form-control(name='email' type='email' autocomplete='email' required='')
        .form-text Only used to reply to you.
      .mb-3
        label.form-label(for='contact-message') Message
        textarea#contact-message.form-control(name='message' rows='8' required='')
      button.btn.btn-primary(type='submit') Send message
